# Visual Design System

## Direction

"Editorial Signal": warm porcelain light surfaces, near-black ink, one cobalt action color, fine hairlines, and a restrained sky-blue glow. Premium through hierarchy and craft, not decoration. Dark mode is optional and inherits the existing dark brand palette.

## Semantic tokens (light, default)

| Token | Value | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `--background` | `#F7F6F2` | warm porcelain |
| `--surface` | `#FFFFFF` | cards, sheets |
| `--surface-muted` | `#EFEEE9` | quiet bands |
| `--foreground` | `#0A0A0B` | 18.3:1 on background |
| `--muted-foreground` | `#52525B` | 7.15:1 on background |
| `--subtle-foreground` | `#71717A` | 4.47:1 - large/decorative only, never body |
| `--accent` | `#1D4ED8` | 6.70:1 with white |
| `--accent-soft` | `#E8EEFF` | accent tint surface |
| `--sky` | `#38BDF8` | decorative glow only |
| `--success` | `#047857` | 5.07:1 on background |
| `--border` | `rgba(10,10,11,0.10)` | hairlines |
| `--border-strong` | `rgba(10,10,11,0.20)` | hover/active |
| `--ring` | `#1D4ED8` | focus ring |

Dark mode tokens are opt-in and may reuse the data file: `#09090B` background, `#121215` surface, `#FAFAFA` text, `#A1A1AA` secondary, `#38BDF8` accent.

Never use raw hex values in components. Map tokens through Tailwind `@theme` and semantic utilities (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `ring-ring`).

## Typography

- Display: Outfit (`--font-outfit`), 500-700 weights.
- Body: Inter (`--font-inter`), 400-500.
- Metadata/code: JetBrains Mono (`--font-jetbrains`), 400-500, uppercase labels sparingly.
- Scale: 12, 14, 16, 18, 22, 28, 36, 48, 64, 88px via `clamp()`.
- Body line-height 1.6; display 0.95-1.05; max measure 68ch.
- Avoid weights below 400. Do not use more than three families.
- Use `text-wrap: balance` on headings and `pretty` on short paragraphs.

## Space, shape, depth

- 4px base grid; component padding 12/16/24; section rhythm 64/96/128.
- Radii: 8, 12, 16, 24, pill. One card radius (20-24px), one control radius (12-14px).
- Borders: 1px hairline, not heavy shadows.
- Shadow: one soft ambient shadow for floating UI only.
- Glass: only sticky nav, sheets, and the 3D fallback frame. Never glass every card.
- Optional 2-3% grain overlay on large hero/section backgrounds; no noisy textures behind text.

## Components

- Buttons: 48px min height, 12px horizontal padding minimum, clear primary/secondary/ghost hierarchy, visible pressed state.
- Focus: 2px ring, 2px offset, never removed.
- Status: use text plus icon/color, not color alone.
- Project cards: editorial, one idea per card, index number, category, status, metric, clear title, one primary action.
- Avoid badge soup. Maximum three metadata chips per card.
- Icons: consistent stroke width and size; decorative icons `aria-hidden`.

## Anti-patterns

- Neon gradients, cyberpunk glows, pure black backgrounds in light mode.
- Glassmorphism on content cards.
- Random accent colors per section.
- Arbitrary `mt-[13px]`, `text-[#...]`, or one-off radii.
- Low-contrast grey body text (`#71717A` at 14px).
- Multiple competing display fonts.
- Decorative 3D or animation with no narrative role.

## Verification

- Contrast check for every text/background pair (4.5:1 body, 3:1 large/UI).
- Search the codebase for raw hex/rgb values outside the token file.
- Screenshot review at 375, 768, 1280, 1440.
- Confirm the design still reads without color (grayscale test).

